n invalid origin result must not poison future reads (0.105625ms)\n✔ successful entries are not evicted by unrelated failures (0.094334ms)\n✔ the API contract is preserved after an origin recovery (0.544709ms)\nℹ tests 11\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 11\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 67.315542\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"node --test benchmark/fixtures/T6-rejected-promise-cache/config-cache.test.mjs benchmark/fixtures/T6-rejected-promise-cache/student-tests.mjs","time":{"start":1787513049504,"end":1787513049506}},"id":"prt_030149103001gwuWFWQeCdw7Zq","sessionID":"ses_fcfec1ec3ffeTM9XJmOkxV2mTm","messageID":"msg_030148cfb001nwh4OUI9G6Bv2k"}}
