{"type":"text","timestamp":1787513058692,"sessionID":"ses_fcfec1ec3ffeTM9XJmOkxV2mTm","part":{"id":"prt_03014ad00001PBOR1Ft8MOd6e6","messageID":"msg_03014aa940018Hru1zAPMPw3Bo","sessionID":"ses_fcfec1ec3ffeTM9XJmOkxV2mTm","type":"text","text":"Root cause: `config-cache.mjs` stored the rejected origin promise in the cache and never removed it, so every later read \"hit\" the same stale failure instead of retrying the origin.\n\nChanged files:\n- `benchmark/fixtures/T6-rejected-promise-cache/config-cache.mjs` — failed loads now delete their own entry if it is still current, enabling retries without evicting replacements.\n- `benchmark/fixtures/T6-rejected-promise-cache/student-tests.mjs` — replaced the placeholder with six regression tests covering retry after failure, late-failure replacement safety, shared failure observation, invalid-result poisoning, tenant isolation, and API contract preservation.\n- `benchmark/fixtures/T6-rejected-promise-cache/INCIDENT.md` — completed with impact, root-cause/code/log evidence, why the logs misled, fix details, regression coverage, and a remaining risk.\n\nVerification result: all tests pass.\n\n```text\n✔ caches successful loads and returns isolated copies\n✔ coalesces concurrent cache misses for one tenant\n✔ retries the origin after a transient load failure\n✔ the API recovers on the request after a transient origin failure\n✔ keeps tenants separate and supports targeted invalidation\n✔ a rejected load is removed so the next read retries the origin\n✔ a late failure for a replaced entry must not evict the replacement\n✔ callers waiting on a failed load all observe the same failure\n✔ an invalid origin result must not poison future reads\n✔ successful entries are not evicted by unrelated failures\n✔ the API contract is preserved after an origin recovery\nℹ tests 11 / pass 11 / fail 0\n```\n\nRemaining concern: there is no back-off or circuit breaker, so a persistently failing origin will be contacted on every new request for that tenant. This is the honest operating limit of the current minimal fix.","time":{"start":1787513056512,"end":1787513058686}}}
